{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:57:43+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:57:43+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Hypoport SE","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"Germany","city":"Berlin","website":"https://www.hypoport.com","employees":2209,"summary":"Hypoport SE develops, operates, and markets technology platforms for the credit, housing, and insurance industries in Germany. The company operates through three segments: Real Estate & Mortgage Platforms, Financing Platforms, and Insurance Platforms. The Real Estate & Mortgage Platforms segment is involved in the development of technology platforms for brokering, financing, and valuing private residential properties. The Financing Platforms segment provides finance products outside the mortgage finance sector, including housing industry, corporate finance, and personal loans. The Insurance Platforms segment develops platforms for insurance distributors in the markets for tariff based retail and small commercial insurance, industrial insurance and occupational insurance. It also operates Europace, an internet based B2B marketplace for the sale of personal loan products and payment protection policies to private clients; Smart Insur platform for the sale and administration of insurance products with variable prices; and Corify and ePension B2B platforms for the administration of industrial insurance, health and occupational pension insurance. Hypoport SE was founded in 1954 and is based in Berlin, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Hypoport SE développe, exploite et commercialise des plateformes technologiques pour les secteurs du crédit, du logement et de l'assurance en Allemagne. La société opère à travers trois segments: Plateformes immobilières et hypothécaires, Plateformes de financement et Plateformes d'assurance. Le secteur des plateformes immobilières et hypothécaires est impliqué dans le développement de plateformes technologiques pour le courtage, le financement et la valorisation des propriétés résidentielles privées."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":554079232,"shares_outstanding":6619824,"trailing_pe":19.510489,"forward_pe":15.309201,"price_to_book":1.4425313,"ev_to_ebitda":15.786,"ev_to_revenue":1.01,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":2.385},"targets":{"current_price":83.7,"mean":155.5,"median":151.5,"high":185.0,"low":134.0,"n_analysts":4,"reco_mean":1.25,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-09"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":null,"dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.41662997,"institutions_pct":0.42446,"institutions_float_pct":0.72760004,"institutions_n":89,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0101,"shares":67313,"value":5634097,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.11359999},{"name":"AIM Fd.s Group -Invesco Intl Small Company Fd.","pct":0.0067000003,"shares":44806,"value":3750262,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.006,"shares":39938,"value":3342810,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0608},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0050999997,"shares":33978,"value":2843958,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0038},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI EAFE Small-Cap ETF","pct":0.0021,"shares":14087,"value":1179081,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.0342},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.S-Vanguard FTSE All-World ex-US Small-Cap ","pct":0.002,"shares":13604,"value":1138654,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.17639999},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI International Developed Markets ETF","pct":0.0015,"shares":9962,"value":833819,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.S-Vanguard European Stock Index 